
1. download magisk from github release
2. in magisk app, select and patch boot.img which from https://ultimateota.d.miui.com/OS1.0.6.0.ULOMIXM/miui_XAGAGlobal_OS1.0.6.0.ULOMIXM_833feef043_14.0.zip, get a new patched boot.img

or get boot.img from the system
adb pull /dev/block/bootdevice/by-name/boot boot.img

3. adb push boot.img /sdcard/Download
adb pull /sdcard/Download/magisk_patched.img .
adb reboot bootloader
sudo su
fastboot devices
fastboot flash boot magisk_patched.img
fastboot reboot
adb shell
su # will show permission grant request on magisk app

# install Shamiko module for hide root 
1. Magisk -> Settings -> randomize output name 
change Magisk packages name to random for prevent by detect

2. download https://github.com/LSPosed/LSPosed.github.io/releases
Magisk -> module install from local -> choose that zip file 
Magisk -> Settings -> Configure DenyList -> three dots right top Show system apps
choose apps won't detect root access
